      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, it doesn't feel like a script i can rewrite. it feels more like a terminal diagnosis. everyone in my family ends up the same way, just broken or gone. it feels like i'm just fighting against physics at this point. why struggle against something that's literally built into my cells?",
